title: Watch one person who is not Jeff use skg, unrequired, for some weeks.
pid: 7d99d580-6e2e-4fd9-bab4-d1e287d0523c
body: |2-
  Begun in Ed's second dream, 2026-11-15, from Grudin's account of why
  group tools fail. Nothing yet shows that a person who is not Jeff
  would keep using skg when nobody requires it; this would, either way.
